          <view class="w-48pct">
        <text class="color-888 fs-12 fw-bold u-mt-5">嵌套1，拍平测试</text><view class="mb-20 bg-list-fff justify-center items-center p-20-0">
          <text class="fs-15 color-text-353535 text-center lh-27" flatten @tap="nestedText1Tap">一级节点黑/白色
            <text class="u-color-red bg-ff0" @tap="nestedText2Tap">二级节点红色且背景色黄色
